@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title UC-P01 - Reserve a Parking Space
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "Parking Service" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA

note over ST,DATA
  Preconditions: Student is signed in and authorized; parking policies are configured.
  Service calls use the signed-in Student's identity.
end note

ST -> UI: Open parking reservation
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get Hubs, vehicle fields and time choices
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Read policies and current parking availability
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Hubs, feasible time choices / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
SVC --> UI: Time choices or explicit retrieval error
deactivate SVC
alt availability retrieved
UI --> ST: Show reservation form and feasible arrival/departure choices
else retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Cannot verify availability; offer retry or exit; do not promise available times
end
deactivate UI
break availability cannot be verified
note over ST,DATA
  End this attempt without a booking; retry after data is available.
end note
end
note over ST,DATA
  Default increment: 15 minutes. Parking interval = [arrival, departure).
  Every covered slot needs capacity. Count occupancy, overlapping holds and unavailable
  spaces without double-counting. Offer arrivals with at least one feasible departure.
end note
ST -> UI: Select/revise Hub, dates, vehicle, arrival and departure
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Validate request, refresh choices and check whole-interval availability
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Read current feasible choices for selected inputs
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Choices / no feasible times / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
opt time choices retrieved and feasible
SVC -> SVC: Validate fields, permitted time points, end > start and rules
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Validation result
deactivate SVC
opt inputs valid
group UC-S02 - Check Parking Availability
SVC -> DATA: Check capacity in EVERY covered slot
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Entire interval available / unavailable / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
end
end
end
SVC --> UI: Validation / availability outcome and summary when available
deactivate SVC
alt read or availability verification failed
UI --> ST: Report retrieval error; no allocation; retry or leave
else no feasible choices or invalid inputs
UI --> ST: Show unavailable choices / field errors; clear departure if no longer offered
else valid inputs and at least one slot unavailable
UI --> ST: Entire interval unavailable; revise, request alternatives or leave
else valid inputs and all slots available
UI --> ST: Review Hub, vehicle and full interval; no allocation yet
end
deactivate UI
break read failed, no feasible choices or invalid inputs
note over ST,DATA
  End this attempt; revise Hub/dates/times or retry, then refresh choices and revalidate.
end note
end
break interval unavailable
note over ST,DATA
  No reservation or partial allocation. Student may revise or leave.
end note
opt Student requests alternatives
ST -> UI: View alternative Hubs for the same interval
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: UC-X01 - Find alternative Hubs (interval)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Read alternative capacity for the entire interval
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Alternatives / none / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
SVC --> UI: Alternatives or explicit error
deactivate SVC
UI --> ST: Select another Hub or decline; selecting does not reserve it
deactivate UI
note over ST,DATA
  If another Hub is selected, start a revised attempt with the same interval.
  Refresh time choices and validate the entire request again.
end note
end
end
ST -> UI: Confirm, edit or cancel reservation
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines, edits or abandons
UI --> ST: No update; revise inputs with revalidation, or leave
else Student confirms
UI -> SVC: Confirm reservation (request, operationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck session and permission
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current access result
deactivate SVC
alt session expired or permission denied
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required / access-denied result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No update attempted
deactivate SVC
else session valid and permission granted
critical Final capacity decision and reservation creation
SVC -> DATA: Reserve whole interval if EVERY slot still has capacity\n(studentId, request, operationRef)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
note over SVC,DATA
  Create ONE Confirmed reservation and all covered holds together, or none.
  Serialize conflicting capacity claims; no overbooking or partial allocation.
end note
DATA --> SVC: Confirmed / unavailable / verification error / save failure
deactivate DATA
end
opt update outcome uncertain / response lost
SVC -> DATA: Find original reservation result (operationRef, studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Original result / still unknown
deactivate DATA
end
end
SVC --> UI: Operation outcome and accessible current details
deactivate SVC
alt access invalid
UI --> ST: Sign in if permitted; reload current records and confirm again
else outcome still unknown
UI --> ST: Outcome unconfirmed; retain operationRef and resolve original result before retry
else save failed
UI --> ST: Report failure; no partial update; retry after reload and revalidation
else capacity unavailable or unverifiable
UI --> ST: No allocation; revise or retry; request alternative Hubs only for unavailable capacity
else reservation confirmed
UI --> ST: Show Confirmed reference, Hub, vehicle and full parking interval
end
end
deactivate UI
note over ST,DATA
  If final capacity is unavailable, UC-X01 follows the same interaction above on request.
  All revised requests need fresh choices, full validation and confirmation.
end note

legend bottom left
  Thin rectangle: execution of a responsibility; nested rectangle: nested execution
  Solid arrow: request / action   |   Dashed arrow: returned result
  Activation ends before waiting for Student input. Read guards top to bottom.
  critical: required consistency boundary; updates are all-or-none as noted
endlegend
footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
